\r\n\r\nPlease note:\r\nΓÇó Custom fondant figures/toppers take 2ΓÇô3 extra days\r\nΓÇó Final design will be shared for your approval before baking\r\nΓÇó We recommend confirming at least 5ΓÇô7 days before your event\r\n\r\nKindly accept the quote and pay the 50% advance to begin crafting your design.',3000.00,'INR','sent','2026-05-29 08:07:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 08:07:52','2026-05-26 08:07:52');
